{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_cae83b625e1e","title":"小众软件","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704906&idx=1&sn=867f45f2c64dcc7430900b0a64199f92&chksm=bce44e965372a82f8d4588c68b2fd3233acb5f28dafc8677bc279eea23ced8b355428eaf31dd&scene=126&sessionid=1795661969#rd","description":"推荐有灵魂的电脑软件、手机应用。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"小众软件","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM5oB1jblgiarD8aOiaYBeEPnOE9DyicmmBJXIdUHFNC0h8MA%2F0","updated":"2026-11-26T01:58:46.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MjM5NDMwMTI2MA%3D%3D:2651704906:1","title":"1Password 遭黑客入侵，部分用户数据泄露","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704906&idx=1&sn=867f45f2c64dcc7430900b0a64199f92&chksm=bce44e965372a82f8d4588c68b2fd3233acb5f28dafc8677bc279eea23ced8b355428eaf31dd&scene=126&sessionid=1795661969#rd","description":"11 月 25 日，知名密码管理器 1Password 发布安全公告<a class=\"wx_img_refer_link\" data-seq=\"3\" data-refer=\"图3\" style=\"\">图3</a>，确认黑客通过一名员工的企业 GitHub 账号入侵内部系统，植入恶意代码，窃取了部分用户的姓名、邮箱、账户 ID 等信息，同时获取了私有源代码及 CI/CD 系统访问权限。\n\n官方称<a class=\"wx_img_refer_link\" data-seq=\"4\" data-refer=\"图4\" style=\"\">图4</a>，用户的密码保险库及其中保存的所有内容、主密码、Secret Key、客户端和浏览器扩展均未受到影响，用户无需修改密码，但应警惕冒充 1Password 的钓鱼邮件、账户恢复请求及诈骗电话。\n\n目前，受影响的用户总数尚未公布。","content":"<p>11 月 25 日，知名密码管理器 1Password 发布安全公告&lt;a class=&quot;wx_img_refer_link&quot; data-seq=&quot;3&quot; data-refer=&quot;图3&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;图3&lt;/a&gt;，确认黑客通过一名员工的企业 GitHub 账号入侵内部系统，植入恶意代码，窃取了部分用户的姓名、邮箱、账户 ID 等信息，同时获取了私有源代码及 CI/CD 系统访问权限。<br /><br />官方称&lt;a class=&quot;wx_img_refer_link&quot; data-seq=&quot;4&quot; data-refer=&quot;图4&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;图4&lt;/a&gt;，用户的密码保险库及其中保存的所有内容、主密码、Secret Key、客户端和浏览器扩展均未受到影响，用户无需修改密码，但应警惕冒充 1Password 的钓鱼邮件、账户恢复请求及诈骗电话。<br /><br />目前，受影响的用户总数尚未公布。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxc9tAIF1Cic4WbJzWVXJTVPicUOic0z6s2Vr6icNozsm3pmZ1k1eozKyzpZtOpyibNASyQLpWXliasKNZEIco8QryrFcO0s7UzwexBibI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxdNkEzveHVeZ1RBdnMA0fKrPib7yMiaW5IL1IhWs3uYyBB8gsyKeLyb9CB8clKjG2Kcr8bUa6xBQoKkkib3HAoZR2uVV9X3tOWicbc%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxcW7jjQ8ghq9zudBIficFoJ6hI2Ea2LdDgy3BJ6T2r05wW8tTXKAFWZxuibrkicumR97I4453Burm1xrnP8PzYq33Le3PdO9uodpI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxdeqcvxgOF124uEGWFwiaVeYC6mFoNhIINuibUgxSE78SWv85AFnOg1cr8pySngRD9lklibNchSurvecE7w1sSPSDN9t5AOREpndU%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTs4Edaib9xxdoDZzYoGlLicNVxLCGuzSDEWmtt6MLf3QXdGarDuAhr85Q8ScrLAl5Wja9a7ez00jpHcclibibib0ibtg3ModaCoETDTk2VqRiciadO8%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxc9tAIF1Cic4WbJzWVXJTVPicUOic0z6s2Vr6icNozsm3pmZ1k1eozKyzpZtOpyibNASyQLpWXliasKNZEIco8QryrFcO0s7UzwexBibI%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxdNkEzveHVeZ1RBdnMA0fKrPib7yMiaW5IL1IhWs3uYyBB8gsyKeLyb9CB8clKjG2Kcr8bUa6xBQoKkkib3HAoZR2uVV9X3tOWicbc%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxcW7jjQ8ghq9zudBIficFoJ6hI2Ea2LdDgy3BJ6T2r05wW8tTXKAFWZxuibrkicumR97I4453Burm1xrnP8PzYq33Le3PdO9uodpI%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FT